	&lt;div class="alert-body"&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;To validate user inputs, we use &lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/go-playground/validator/v10" target="_blank" &gt;&lt;code&gt;validator/v10&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and a Go generics based middleware to validate and send the validated form to the handler directly, to improve developers’ productivity.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Initialize the Server</title><link>https://learning-cloud-native-go.github.io/docs/initialize-the-server/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-cloud-native-go.github.io/docs/initialize-the-server/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="create-new-go-module"&gt;Create New Go Module&lt;/h2&gt;


&lt;div class="alert alert-important"&gt;
	&lt;div class="alert-header"&gt;
		
		

	&lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20px"&gt;&lt;path d="M479.79-360q15.21 0 25.71-10.29t10.5-25.5q0-15.21-10.29-25.71t-25.5-10.5q-15.21 0-25.71 10.29t-10.5 25.5q0 15.21 10.29 25.71t25.5 10.5Zm25.71-130.35Q516-500.7 516-516v-192q0-15.3-10.29-25.65Q495.42-744 480.21-744t-25.71 10.35Q444-723.3 444-708v192q0 15.3 10.29 25.65Q464.58-480 479.79-480t25.71-10.35ZM240-240l-82.88 82.88Q140-140 118-149.41q-22-9.4-22-33.59v-609q0-29.7 21.15-50.85Q138.3-864 168-864h624q29.7 0 50.85 21.15Q864-821.7 864-792v480q0 29.7-21.15 50.85Q821.7-240 792-240H240Zm-30-72h582v-480H168v522l42-42Zm-42 0v-480 480Z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;


		&lt;span&gt;
		
			If you&amp;rsquo;re new to Go&amp;hellip;
		
		&lt;/span&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
	&lt;div class="alert-body"&gt;
		&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/tutorial/create-module" target="_blank" &gt;Go module&lt;/a&gt; is a collection of related Go packages that are versioned together as a single unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most often, a version control repository contains exactly one module defined in the repository root. Go also support &lt;a href="https://go.dev/doc/tutorial/workspaces" target="_blank" &gt;multi-module workspaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run following commands to create the Go module.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Learning Cloud Native Go</title><link>https://learning-cloud-native-go.github.io/journal/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://learning-cloud-native-go.github.io/journal/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="2026-january-19"&gt;2026: January 19&lt;/h2&gt;
